            <run fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>aVTc w/ 30m estimate</run>
            <run> uses 30m geofence if available, else 150m geofence + 90 seconds&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>aWTp</run>
            <run> uses 150m geofence, but adds walk in estimate and 60 seconds for &apos;handling time&apos;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
